OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F337A1786915122
OL,3,CDrug dealer who escaped prison and
OL,4,Cfled to Thailand jailed
OL,6,FA drug dealer who lived a "lavish
OL,7,Flifestyle" after escaping from prison
OL,8,Fand fleeing to Thailand has been
OL,9,Fjailed.
OL,11,FKyle Nelson, 38, was caught after he
OL,12,Freturned to the UK to continue selling
OL,13,Fclass A drugs a year after he flew
OL,14,Fabroad.
OL,16,FNorth Yorkshire Police said he was
OL,17,F"back where he belongs" after he was
OL,18,Fjailed for 11 years.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/4
