FL,338,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F337A1786915122
OL,3,CDrug dealer who escaped prison and
OL,4,Cfled to Thailand jailed
OL,6,FNelson, who is from Manchester but
OL,7,Flived in Acomb, York, was originally
OL,8,Flocked up for nine years in 2022 for
OL,9,Fselling drugs including heroin and
OL,10,Fcrack cocaine.
OL,12,FAfter being moved to an open prison he
OL,13,Fescaped while on day release in 2024
OL,14,Fand travelled to Scotland and Ireland
OL,15,Fbefore flying to Thailand using forged
OL,16,Fpassports under the names Carl Green
OL,17,Fand James Tetley.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/4
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,338,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F337A1786915122
OL,3,CDrug dealer who escaped prison and
OL,4,Cfled to Thailand jailed
OL,6,FNorth Yorkshire Police said he
OL,7,F"embarked on a lavish lifestyle" and
OL,8,Fwas pictured on a jet ski as well as
OL,9,Fbuying items including a Rolex watch.
OL,11,FThe force said he immediately returned
OL,12,Fto selling class A drugs under the
OL,13,Fcodename "Banksy line" after moving
OL,14,Fback to the UK in 2025.
OL,16,FHe was arrested after a vehicle
OL,17,Ftravelling from Wetherby to York in
OL,18,FApril 2025 was stopped and searched by
OL,19,Fpolice, who found a mobile phone
OL,20,Fcontaining incriminating information.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G3/4
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
