OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,338,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F337A1786915122
OL,3,CDrug dealer who escaped prison and
OL,4,Cfled to Thailand jailed
OL,6,FHe was found guilty of drug dealing
OL,7,Fand unlawful escape from prison.
OL,9,FPC Wayne Sharrocks said: "Kyle Nelson
OL,10,Fused his extensive criminal network to
OL,11,Fescape from a nine-year prison
OL,12,Fsentence for drug supply offences,
OL,13,Fflee the country, and live a life of
OL,14,Fluxury abroad.
OL,16,F"In this instance we were able to
OL,17,Fgather evidence, attribute it to
OL,18,FNelson and arrest him within weeks of
OL,19,Fbecoming aware of the Banksy drugs
OL,20,Fline and put Nelson back behind bars,
OL,21,Fwhere he belongs."
OL,26,@qD@ZOUxD@AOU
